 {"q": "Language modeling's unifying role is:",
  "choices": ["It's one task among many", "Next-token prediction underlies n-grams, RNNs, and transformers alike", "It's obsolete", "Only for chatbots"],
  "answer": 1,
  "explain": "The constant across eras; architectures are the variable — Concepts, step 6 of the Hands-on procedure."},
